# It reads tunable coonfigurations from intermediate files, config_kernel.mk and
# config_kernel.h, generated by '$ make config'.
# It translates IMG tunable configurations in Makefile to Bazel configurations.
# Same combinations of configurations from Makefile and Bazel should compile
# same files.

# For sources files that are separated by configurations, they may be located by
# by rogue and volcanic,... , and some common files. By naminbg, if seeing
# 'common' as suffix to the sources,
# ex 'FILES_SUPPORT_FALLBACK_FENCE_SYNC_common', it indicates there are other
# parts of source files located under path/to/rogue|volcanic, etc..., and
# defined in BUILD.bazel in that path.


